		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">8</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.
There are various things to be implemented.
a. Taking input into a variable (step 1,2,3 and 7)
b. Creating new variables (steps 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5)
c. Check if one number is same as another number (step 9)
d. Displaying output (step 12)
e. Repeating the check for one number at a time
f. Stop reading the inputs by using break.

We have discussed all the above in previous assignments multiple times..</attribute>
